  "body": "Welcome to Lot 4 at 11 The Terrace, Takapuna - a brand-new, architecturally designed residence within an exclusive boutique development of just six freehold homes.\r\n\r\nThis is contemporary Takapuna living with a difference - thoughtfully designed, beautifully finished, and created for those who appreciate quality without compromising on lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThree Levels. Endless Possibilities.\r\n\r\nDesigned around modern living, Lot 4 offers a highly versatile three-level layout with space for every stage of life.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor features a generous lounge with its own ensuite and wardrobe. Use it as a second living space, media room, home office, guest retreat - or easily transform it into a third bedroom when required.\r\n\r\nThe middle level forms the social heart of the home, with an expansive open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area designed for effortless entertaining and relaxed everyday living.\r\n\r\nAt the centre is a sophisticated designer kitchen featuring premium Miele appliances and an integrated fridge, seamlessly matched with the cabinetry for a clean, streamlined finish.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, two beautifully appointed bedrooms create a private sanctuary, including luxurious ensuite accommodation and an elevated outlook.\r\n\r\nDesign With Personality\r\n\r\nForget the predictable townhouse.\r\n\r\nLot 4 embraces a more confident design philosophy, with bold colour combinations, statement bathroom finishes and carefully selected materials creating a home that feels individual and considered.\r\n\r\nEvery detail has been chosen to add character without compromising sophistication.\r\n\r\nThis is architecture with personality - a home that looks and feels different from the moment you walk through the door.\r\n\r\nPremium Features\r\n\r\n* Brand-new architecturally designed three-level residence\r\n* Boutique development of only six homes\r\n* Freehold title\r\n* No body corporate fees\r\n* Flexible multi-level living\r\n* Ensuite accommodation on the ground floor\r\n* Two bedrooms upstairs\r\n* Designer open-plan kitchen and living\r\n* Premium Miele kitchen appliances\r\n* Integrated fridge seamlessly incorporated into the kitchen\r\n* High-spec fixtures and finishes throughout\r\n* Internal access garage\r\n* Optional lift installation available - quotation available on request\r\n* 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nTakapuna - Lifestyle Without Compromise\r\n\r\nPositioned on The Terrace, Lot 4 places you within easy reach of everything that makes Takapuna one of Auckland's most sought-after coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a morning walk along Takapuna Beach, coffee at your favourite café, dinner at one of the many restaurants, or an afternoon browsing Shore City - all within moments of home.\r\n\r\nYet The Terrace offers a quieter, more residential setting away from the hustle and bustle of the main roads.\r\n\r\nBeach. Dining. Shopping. Convenience. Community.\r\n\r\nIt is all here.\r\n\r\n**Some photos were taken from different units for reference only**",
